                   return (towctrans(wc, wctrans("toupper")));
           }

EERRRROORRSS
     The ttoowwccttrraannss() function will fail if:

     [EINVAL]           The supplied _d_e_s_c argument is invalid.

     The wwccttrraannss() function will fail if:

     [EINVAL]           The requested mapping name is invalid.

